:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Killer Tank Cat (Enemy)]].''
'''Killer Tank Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when clearing Levels 2, 4 or 9 of [[Horde of Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 695
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Killer Tank Cat
|name2 = True Killer Tank Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''True Killer Tank Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This is a <u>joke character</u>. He has the stats of a meatshield, but an insanely high cost (tied for the highest in the game!), which makes him, by far, the least cost-efficient cat you could ever use in a stage, alongside the first and second forms of his [[Killer Cat (Rare Cat)|rounder brother]]. Unlike Killer Cat though, he lacks any [[Cat Combo]]s, making him mostly worthless outside of [[User Rank]]. One last perk about him is his usefulness in obtaining [[Meow Medals]] that require spending lots of money on units, such as ''Nouveau Riche''.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

